score = 20;
console.log(score);
```

A. `10`

B. `20`

C. `undefined`

D. Error

### Q3. Which keyword prevents reassignment of a variable binding?

A. `var`

B. `let`

C. `const`

D. `console`

### Q4. What is the output?

```js
console.log(price);
var price = 100;
```

A. `100`

B. `null`

C. `undefined`

D. `ReferenceError`

### Q5. What happens here?

```js
