  var a = 10;
  let b = 20;
  const c = 30;
}
```

A. Only `a`

B. Only `b`

C. Only `c`

D. All three

### Q7. What is scope?

A. The number of functions in a program

B. The area in which a variable can be accessed

C. The output of a function

D. A type of loop

